FormFactor, High Bandwidth Memory and Advanced Packaging: https://www.formfactor.com/videos/mission-central-high-bandwidth-memory-a-key-component-of-advanced-packaging/

TSMC, 3DFabric: https://3dfabric.tsmc.com/english/dedicatedFoundry/technology/3DFabric.htm

UCIe Consortium, Specifications: https://www.uciexpress.org/specifications

All numeric examples are invented teaching assumptions, not company specifications or forecasts.

